  "id": "catatonic-state",
  "term": "catatonic state",
  "definition": "A catatonic state is a condition of catatonia, a severe psychomotor disturbance marked by abnormal movement that can be either unusually increased or greatly slowed. When it is prolonged or severe, it can also interfere with communication.",
